    <string name="settings_custom_unit_cannabis_joint_hint" formatted="false">When smoking a joint about 23% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke a joint with 300mg of a bud that has 20% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 23/100 = 13.8mg THC.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_cannabis_bong_hint" formatted="false">When smoking with a bong about 40% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke 300mg of a bud that has 20% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 40/100 = 24mg THC.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_cannabis_vape_hint" formatted="false">When smoking with a vaporizer about 70% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke 300mg of a bud that has 20% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 70/100 = 42mg THC.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_shrooms_dried_hint" formatted="false">Dried Psilocybe cubensis contain around 1% of Psilocybin.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_shrooms_fresh_hint" formatted="false">Fresh Psilocybe cubensis contain around 0.1% of Psilocybin.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_shrooms_research_hint">Research the strain of mushroom you have to be able to estimate the amount of Psilocybin it contains.</string>
    <string name="settings_custom_unit_alcohol_hint" formatted="false">1 ml of Ethanol is 0.8g. So if you are e.g. consuming 200ml of a spirit with 40% of Alcohol you are consuming 200ml * 40/100 * 0.8 = 64g Ethanol.</string>
